<title>USA: Some US corn gluten meal prices up, trade brisk.</title>
<headline>Some US corn gluten meal prices up, trade brisk.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten meal values were steady to higher Tuesday, with some sources quoting only nominal values. &quot;I'm out,&quot; said one dealer. &quot;Business is pretty good.&quot;</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   97.00     97.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     May	-  345.00    343.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   89.00     89.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  350.00    350.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
